<title>USA: Tetra Tech signs contract with EPA.</title>
<headline>Tetra Tech signs contract with EPA.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tetra Tech Inc said Thursday it signed a contract with the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency with a potential value of about $173 million over 10 years.</p>
<p>It said the contract is for site investigations, remedial design and maintenance at hazardous waste sites.</p>
<p>The contract covers work in Delaware, Pennsylvania, Maryland, Washington D.C., Virginia and West Virginia.</p>
